Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Aegis ICS Operations Team <support@aegis-ics.internal>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31)
Recommends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 | libwebkit2gtk-4.0-37, libgtk-3-0
Description: Aegis ICS - Industrial Zero-Trust Security Gateway & Physical Enforcer
 Production-ready zero-trust security gateway, physical safety enforcer,
 and real-time SCADA monitoring application built for Industrial Control
 Systems (ICS) and Operational Technology (OT) environments.
 Features multi-variable Stuxnet hazard boundaries, HMAC-SHA256 telemetry
 verification, 5-feature Random Forest anomaly detection, and automated
 incident reporting adhering to NIST SP 800-82 Rev 3 and NIST SP 800-53 Rev 5.
